nder as a child Node of model's left hand. \n\nSelect the Animation player, remport the glb while an animation (e.g. Dance) is playing.\nNow, See the cylinder on the model's left hand is now wrongly offset.\n\nOnly happens when animation playing during reimport process.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[skelbug-4-7.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31618884/skelbug-4-7.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123005/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}